# Environment catalog (source audit: 2026-10-16).
# Runtime settings are above; supply real required values locally before starting the relevant component.
# Separate components / execution contexts (use the template beside that component):
# - .env.build.example
# - .env.ci.example
# - .env.sample
# - .env.system.example
# Named helpers, schema fields, OIDC prefixes and checked-in connector maps were also reviewed.

# Configuration is a catalog, not automatic secret provisioning.
# Runtime .env loading follows this repository's README; build/CI/OS examples are reference-only.

